Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: breeze-icon-theme, papirus-icon-theme
Description: Amber-on-charcoal icon theme overlay for Meridian OS
 Meridian Icon Pack is a curated icon theme in Meridian OS's amber-on-
 charcoal visual style. It themes the application launcher, a growing
 set of application icons, the full folder/places set, and panel/tray
 status glyphs, falling through to Papirus-Dark and Breeze for
 anything not yet covered.
 .
 Works standalone on any Debian system running KDE Plasma (or any
 desktop that reads the freedesktop icon theme spec) — not limited to
 Meridian OS itself.
